# Zahur, Glory's Past: "Max speed - Whenever a nontoken creature you control dies, create a tapped 2/2 black Zombie creature token."
# A leaves-the-battlefield ability looks back in time (CR 603.10a): Zahur dying at max speed sees its own death, as it had the
# ability just before, and makes one tapped Zombie. Lightning Bolt to Bot2's face on turns 3, 5 and 7 brings the speed to 4
# (CR 702.179d); then a fourth Bolt kills Zahur (3/2).

